# Glider boot log - 2026-08-16 - BLACK SCREEN (panel never came up on this plug-in)
#
# Reconstructed from a session where syslog was read one entry at a time (see the
# README's "Reading the device's own log" correction - the trailing-newline bug).
# Entry text and timestamps are verbatim; only the read method was piecemeal.
#
# Note what is NOT wrong here: DP locks at the correct timing, all EPD rails are in
# spec, the FPGA loads and starts, and the final input status matches a working boot.
# The only structural difference from boot-working-2026-08-16.log is that
# "DP enabled" (HPD high) lands AFTER "FPGA started with status 21" instead of before.

